[Music]  get ready to dive into the battlefield  in for honor master the medieval  weaponry as the bold Knights brutal  Vikings and lethal samurai prepare for  vicious fast-paced melee combat and  become the ultimate warrior but which of  the three legendary factions will you  choose here's what you need to know to  win glory as the samurai brought to you  by for honor the samurai have endured a  tragic history of a homeland lost to sea  and fire they have now built a new  empire near the lands of the Vikings and  the Knights though they remain  outnumbered by their neighbors they must  rely on their greater martial skill and  cunning to survive as the last of their  kind enjoining the samurai of the dawn  Empire you select from heroes that have  spent their lives fighting and training  and possess an unbreakable will you get  the chance to wield katanas Spears or  clubs Master the samurai in order to  defeat the Knights and the Vikings  here's what we know about the samurai  subclasses so far the Ken se are masters  of multiple martial arts and are medium  level samurai they are balanced samurai  armed with heavy armor and the new da  Chi a longer version of the katana they  are slower than other units but have a  longer melee range ken say our excellent  mid-range heavy fighters thanks to their  long katanas they deal heavy damage and  our semi fast attackers with a good  amount of health compared to other heavy  heroes they can't stay in battle for  long periods of time and they don't pack  the same punishment taking health damage  luring enemies into closed off spaces  allows for your longsword to strike them  at a safe distance keeping you away from  their attack range for example the  Knights peacekeeper is a dangerous open  area fighter but corner her in a closed  in space and the no dachi will do the  rest  the Kensei combine their light attacks  with finishing heavy swings serving as  one of the best offensive heavy heroes  on the field  shigeki are easy level disruptor tanks  they may appear slow and cumbersome but  are incredibly strong and can absorb  many hits  shigeaki are armed with the pen a bow a  traditional club that can deliver a  crippling blow the tank on the field  shigeaki packed the heaviest damage  dealing weapon with the highest health  of any hero should go PR best at  clearing the way for their team due to  high damage capabilities and health the  shigeki are the slowest moving and  fighting heroes they have an easy tell  on their swing attacks that can be  blocked quickly and they take longer to  cross the field from point A to B tchy  goki are best when used as a stationary  fighter when taking on the power of the  Knights warden the brute strength of the  shego key will crush her armor with just  a few heavy swings let the enemy come to  you by luring them to unclaimed capture  points or by leading them to their  allies body waiting to be revived any  enemy you face will have to be at the  top of their game in order to survive  your power  the Orochi are the Imperial assassins of  the samurai they are trained in the arts  of stealth and deception armed with  light armor and a katana  they have strong counter-attacks but  requires skill and timing to have an  effective defense the Orochi are beloved  as one of the best light characters with  high damage quick movement and attack  speed  much like the peacekeeper and berserkers  the Orochi specialize in hit-and-run  tactics with the ability to sneak behind  enemy lines to capture points or to help  finish a fleeing foe due to such low  armor health the Orochi can't stay in a  chaotic fight for too long despite  having fast blocking the Orochi should  avoid being outnumbered when teamed up  with heavy allied heroes they combine to  make one of the best combo tag teams on  the battlefield masters of strengths  such as the Vikings carry the rage but  with the combined swiftness of the ero  cheese blade and feet they can run  circles and slice any foe in half  the no bushi are elegant fighters that  move like the wind they are armed with  the naginata a long versatile weapon  with a curved blade they had the  lightest armor making them fast but  unable to take a lot of damage the Nobu  she is a zone character she tries to  keep her distance while constantly  pestering any attackers she has the  longest attack range of the samurai and  has a fast revive the Nobu she has the  weakest armor in the samurai ranks  support roles and hit-and-run tactics  best suit her in combat her naginata is  excellent for keeping enemies at a  distance use her light attacks comboed  with a few heavy attacks on your foes be  warned her heavy attacks can easily be  parried leaving her vulnerable it only  takes a few heavy attacks to bring her  down pledge your sword to the samurai of  the dawn Empire and join the war of the  factions who will reign supreme be sure  to check out our other videos to learn  about the other factions Knights and  Vikings brought to you by for honor for  honor is available on February 14 2017  and for all your for honor needs stick  with GameSpot

